    "created_at": "2023-03-09T20:13:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-03-09T20:13:18Z",
    "body": "AFAIK WebKit uses the ICU library for IDNA. In ICU a check is added to report failure on `xn--` and `xn--ASCII-` labels after the [\"If the label starts with “xn--”\"](https://unicode.org/reports/tr46/#ProcessingStepPunycode) step. This check hasn't been added to UTS 46 standard yet. More info here:\r\n* https://github.com/unicode-org/icu/pull/1234 \r\n* https://unicode-org.atlassian.net/browse/ICU-21030\r\n\r\nThis explains, why these tests return an error in the WebKit, but success in the whatwg-url.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
